+<section class="wrap plans" id="plans" aria-label="Plans">
+<article class="plan"><h2>Free</h2><p class="plan-desc">A simple start for small, close-knit teams.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="0" data-year="0">$0</span><span class="per">/ user / month</span></div><div class="year-note">Always free</div><hr><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span>Unlimited messages</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>1:1 and group conversations</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Up to 10 team members</li></ul><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Start%20with%20Relay%20Free">Get started free</a></article>
