+<article class="plan"><h2>Business</h2><p class="plan-desc">More control and support for growing organizations.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="15" data-year="12">$15</span><span class="per">/ user / month</span></div><div class="year-note" data-annual-note> </div><hr><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span>Everything in Team</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Advanced admin controls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Single sign-on (SSO)</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Priority support</li></ul><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Business%20inquiry">Choose Business</a></article>
