+<section class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-head"><h2 id="faq-title">A few things you might be wondering</h2><p>Still curious? <a href="mailto:hello@relay.example">Talk to our team</a>.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Absolutely. The Free plan is free to use, with no credit card required. You can upgrade whenever your team is ready.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and pay for the year upfront. The per-user monthly equivalent is 20% lower than monthly billing; you can switch plans as your needs change.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><p>Yes. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time. Changes are straightforward, and you keep access through the end of your paid period.</p></details><details><summary>What counts as a user?</summary><p>Each active team member with a Relay account counts as one user. Your Team or Business price scales with the number of members on your workspace.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving our team to Relay?</summary><p>We’re happy to help. Business customers get priority support, and any team can reach us at hello@relay.example.</p></details></div></section>
